h1 如意 (Nyoy)
p.lead ローカル生成AI — 画像生成

= render "shared/sd_catalog_status"

p = link_to "新しい画像を生成", new_image_generation_path, class: "button"

- if @image_generations.any?
  section.card-list
    - @image_generations.each do |generation|
      = link_to image_generation_path(generation), class: "card" do
        .card-header
          span class="status status-#{generation.status}" = generation.status
          span.model = generation.sd_model
        p.prompt = truncate(generation.japanese_prompt, length: 80)
        - if generation.image.attached?
          = image_tag generation.image.variant(resize_to_limit: [256, 256]), alt: generation.japanese_prompt
- else
  p.empty まだ生成履歴がありません。
